 for improved wear resistance in milling operations.", "long_description": "The EM-6-4F-TIALN is a solid carbide end mill manufactured by Sandvik Coromant, configured with 4 flutes and a 6mm cutting diameter. The tool has a flute length of 13mm and an overall length of 57mm, with a 6mm shank diameter matching the cutting diameter for standard collet compatibility.\n\nConstruction is solid carbide, providing rigidity and heat resistance suited to milling applications. The tool is coated with TiAlN (Titanium Aluminum Nitride), a coating commonly applied to cutting tools to reduce friction and extend tool life under elevated cutting temperatures.\n\nWith a 4-flute geometry, this end mill is suited to applications requiring a balance between chip evacuation and surface finish. The 6mm shank and cutting diameter allow direct fitment into standard 6mm collets or holders without adapters.\n\nConfirm flute length and overall length against your application's depth-of-cut and reach requirements before ordering, as this configuration has a 13mm flute length within a 57mm overall length.", "bullets": ["MPN: EM-6-4F-TIALN \u2014 Sandvik Coromant solid carbide end mill", "4-flute design", "Cutting diameter: 6 mm", "Shank diameter: 6 mm", "Flute length: 13 mm", "Overall length: 57 mm", "Coating: TiAlN", "Tool material: Solid Carbide"], "meta_description": "Sandvik Coromant EM-6-4F-TIALN: 4-flute solid carbide end mill, 6mm cutting dia, TiAlN coating, 13mm flute length, 57mm overall length.", "keywords": ["Sandvik Coromant end mill", "solid carbide end mill", "TiAlN coated end mill", "4-flute end mill", "6mm end mill", "EM-6-4F-TIALN"], "search_terms": ["EM-6-4F-TIALN", "EM 6 4F TIALN", "Sandvik EM-6-4F-TIALN", "6mm 4 flute carbide end mill", "TiAlN 6mm end mill", "Sandvik Coromant 4 flute end mill"]}, "issues": [], "readiness": {"overall": 96.2, "completeness": 94.0, "confidence": 94.4, "validity": 100.0, "verdict": "publish", "missing_required": [], "notes": ["Record meets the p